      "extract": "Knot-quiver correspondence (KQC) conjectured by Kucharski-Reineke-Stosic-Sulkowski [1] provides a new encoding of HOMFLY-PT invariants of knots in terms of the representation theory of quivers. Such a correspondence was motivated by studying the supersymmetric quiver quantum mechanics description of BPS states in brane systems describing knots [2]. Quivers are denoted as directed graphs with finite number of",
